{"id":"daneben","lemma":"daneben","pos":"adv","rank":1965,"glosses":["next to it, next to that"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e7/De-daneben.ogg/De-daneben.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"War er in dem Auto oder daneben?","en":"Was he in the car or by the car?","words":[{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"car"},{"g":"or"},null]},{"text":"Ich lag völlig daneben.","en":"I was completely wrong.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/698731","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},{"g":"completely"},null]},{"text":"Es ging fast daneben.","en":"It was a near miss.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"almost"},null]},{"text":"Manchmal geht alles daneben.","en":"Sometimes everything goes wrong.","words":[{"g":"sometimes"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"everything"},null]},{"text":"Der Plan ging daneben.","en":"The plan has failed.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"project"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},null]}]}